### 1. READ ALL TASKS (GET)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. CREATE A TASK (POST)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn Mongoose",
  "description": "Connect Express to MongoDB"
}

###

### 3. VALIDATION ERROR TEST (POST - Missing Title)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This should fail because there is no title."
}

###

### 4. UPDATE A TASK (PUT)
# Replace <REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID> with an ID from the GET request above.
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/<REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "description": "Connect Express to MongoDB - Updated!"
}

###

### 5. DELETE A TASK (DELETE)
# Replace <REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID> with an ID from the GET request above.
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/<REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID>
